===Obtain an RFID card encryption device===
This objective is scripted to fail. To progress toward failing this objective, you must survive a total of at least 30 minutes on [[The Lab]]. The amount of raids to do so doesn't matter. Once the objective shows as failed, you will be contacted by Mr. Kerman to tell you to ask [[Mechanic]] for some help.

===Talk to [[Mechanic]]===
Visit [[Mechanic]] in the menu through the trader screen to ask for help. He will tell you that he needs to contact his friend.

===Wait for a response from [[Mechanic]]===
It takes 6-12 hours for [[Mechanic]] to reach out to you.

