===Talk to Mr. Kerman===
'''<font color="red">This is an important point of no return choice!</font>'''

Visit Mr. Kerman through the hideout intelligence center laptop screen. He will ask you to help him find dirt on TerraGroup. You need to say yes to helping him.

'''Refusing to find dirt on TerraGroup will end this ending's route.'''

===Agree to find dirt on TerraGroup for Mr. Kerman===
====Intelligence Center level 3====
You need to have [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center level 3]] built in order to send the evidence to Mr. Kerman.

===Deliver the 8 major TerraGroup evidence to Mr. Kerman===
'''<font color="red">This is an important point of no return choice!</font>'''

After handing in 2 of the 8 major evidence, you will be asked if you want to continue or not. You need to refuse to hand in any more major evidence to continue. While one major evidence can be obtained from the [[Cardinal apartment key]] bedroom safe, at least one [[story chapter]] will have to be progressed to obtain a second major evidence.

'''Agreeing to find more dirt on TerraGroup will end this ending's route.'''

====Rewards====
* Unlocks access to [[To the Light - Getting Acquainted]]
* Unlocks achievement [[Achievements#Achievements|U-Turn]]

===Ask the traders how to escape from Tarkov===
You will need to ask every trader how to escape Tarkov, visiting [[Lightkeeper]] last.

====Rewards====
* Unlocks craft for [[Military flash drive with topographic intel]] at [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence center 1]]

