Once all the amulets have been stashed, you will need to visit [[Lightkeeper]] to confirm the task is done. After speaking to [[Lightkeeper]] you will receive a [[RFID keycard with unknown name]] to use at the intercom on [[Shoreline]].
====Rewards====
* 1x [[RFID keycard with unknown name]]
* Unlocks purchase of [[RFID keycard with unknown name]] from [[Lightkeeper]]